+# S5-CLM-00003493 — `maximalLength_le_isBigO`
+
+This directory is the complete target-local handoff for the frozen FC-SORRY
+theorem `Arxiv.«1609.08688».maximalLength_le_isBigO`.
+
+The Lean implementation is under
+`Formalizations/Lean/AwesomeTheorems/Stage5/Theorems/S5_CLM_00003493/`:
+
+- `Statement.lean` replays the source utility, definitions, and exact
+  existential proposition.
+- `Proof.lean` proves the quadratic extremal bound by a first-two-coordinate
+  pigeonhole argument and closes the literal target with the signed witness
+  `Ω n = -|Real.iteratedLog n|`.
+- `Audit.lean` checks the root, both transports, and the kernel axiom census.
+
+The JSON and Markdown siblings are content-addressed evidence for intake,
+statement crosswalk, anchors, proof DAG, machine closure, readability,
+validation, and release.  `meta.json` is the package index.  The release
+decision is a worker-level `accepted` handoff pending independent canonical
+Master replay; it does not modify the shared repository or advance any catalog.
